[style name="dialogue_style"]
join detective right
if {has_searched_cabinet} == true:
	detective: Do you mind if I take another look in your cabinet, just to make sure?
	join cook left
	cook: Go ahead.
else:
	set {has_searched_cabinet} = true
	detective: Would you mind if I searched the cabinets?
	join cook left
	cook: Not at all.

You open the cabinets and follow the gardener's directions.
detective (thinking): What's this? [GARDENER] was telling the truth about the secret compartment.
cook (unamused): Wait...
detective: A pouch of garlic cloves...
cook: No—
detective: And a wooden stake?
cook (squinting): What—
detective (speaking): This doesn't look good for you, [COOK].
Sealed pouch of garlic cloves added to journal
Wooden stake added to journal
[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"add_evidence":"garlic_pouch"}"]
[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"add_evidence":"second_stake"}"]
